@startuml current-system-model
!include theme.puml
title Current System Model — Traditional Manual Analytics & Reporting

|#FDEEDF|Business Staff|
start
:Pull figures manually from\nseparate tools and emails;
:Type records into\nExcel spreadsheets;

|#E8F1FB|Data Analyst|
:Merge many spreadsheets\nby hand;
:Clean and fix errors\nmanually;
:Build charts and pivot\ntables one by one;
:Email a static report\n(PDF / slides);

|#E7F6EE|Management|
:Read emailed / printed\nreport;
if (Numbers clear and\nup to date?) then (yes)
  :Make decision based on\npast (often outdated) data;
  stop
else (no)
  :Send questions back\nby email (days lost);
  :Wait for the analyst\nto redo the report;
  stop
endif

@enduml
